+//           Override N_SPLIT=8 (1 block/split), BLOCK_M=16.
+//   DK=96 : DK/32 = 3 blocks, not divisible by the default N_SPLIT=2 ->
+//           override N_SPLIT=3. BLOCK_M must be 16, not 32: the N_SPLIT=3
